author=avdim
description=Galaxy Tab S 10.5 Wi-Fi, LineageOS 17.1 deathly: Bluetooth call audio, mic gain, VoIP to the speaker (no earpiece), working echo canceller config; speaker hardware EQ + limiter/loudness (WM5102, only with the hook-free kernel zip); fingerprint unlock (fixed HAL) and "swipe" wording in the enrolment pages.
